<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>IRONHAUS</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#0C0C0E;--panel:#141417;--lime:#C6F53C;--ink:#0C0C0E;--muted:#8A8D93;}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:#fff}
.head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 56px;border-bottom:1px solid #1E1E22}
.logo{font-family:'Anton';font-size:26px;letter-spacing:2px}
.logo span{color:var(--lime)}
.nav{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#C4C6CB}
.join{background:var(--lime);color:#0C0C0E;font-weight:700;padding:12px 24px;font-size:14px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
.hero{padding:96px 56px 100px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(12,12,14,.96) 0%,rgba(12,12,14,.82) 42%,rgba(12,12,14,.45) 100%),
 url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554344728-77cf90d9ed26?w=1700&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop') center 25%/cover no-repeat}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:100%;height:4px;background:var(--lime);z-index:0}
.hero .in{position:relative;z-index:2}
.tag{color:var(--lime);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:20px}
.hero h1{font-family:'Anton';font-size:120px;line-height:.86;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-1px;max-width:820px}
.hero h1 span{color:var(--lime)}
.hero p{margin-top:26px;max-width:460px;color:#B7BAC0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.6}
.cta{margin-top:36px;display:flex;gap:16px}
.btn{background:var(--lime);color:#0C0C0E;border:none;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;padding:18px 36px;font-family:'Inter'}
.btn-o{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:2px solid #2A2A30;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;padding:16px 30px}
.stats{display:flex;gap:60px;margin-top:56px}
.stats div{position:relative;z-index:2}
.stats span{font-family:'Anton';font-size:44px;color:var(--lime);display:block;line-height:1}
.stats p{color:#8A8D93;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:13px;margin-top:4px}
.plans{padding:70px 56px;background:var(--panel)}
.plans h2{font-family:'Anton';font-size:48px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:36px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.p{background:#0C0C0E;border:1px solid #22232A;padding:32px 28px}
.p.hot{border-color:var(--lime);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#16180F,#0C0C0E)}
.p .k{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.p.hot .k{color:var(--lime)}
.p .price{font-family:'Anton';font-size:54px;margin:10px 0 4px}
.p .price small{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);font-family:'Inter'}
.p ul{list-style:none;margin-top:18px;color:#C4C6CB;font-size:15px}
.p li{padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1C1D23}
.p li::before{content:"›";color:var(--lime);margin-right:10px;font-weight:700}
.foot{padding:34px 56px;color:#7C7F86;font-size:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #1E1E22}
@media(max-width:760px){
 .head{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;padding:14px 22px}
 .nav{display:none}
 .hero{padding:52px 22px 60px}
 .hero h1{font-size:60px;line-height:.9}
 .hero p{font-size:16px}
 .cta{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
 .stats{gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:40px}
 .plans{padding:48px 22px}
 .plans h2{font-size:38px}
 .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .foot{flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:24px 22px}
}
</style></head>
<body>
<header class="head">
  <div class="logo">IRON<span>HAUS</span></div>
  <nav class="nav"><span>Classes</span><span>Coaching</span><span>Memberships</span><span>Results</span></nav>
  <a class="join">Start Free Trial</a>
</header>
<section class="hero"><div class="in">
  <div class="tag">Strength &amp; conditioning · Tampa</div>
  <h1>Show up.<br><span>Get strong.</span></h1>
  <p>Coach-led small-group training that actually gets results — no lock-in contracts, no ego, just work that pays off.</p>
  <div class="cta"><button class="btn">Start Free Trial</button><button class="btn-o">View Classes</button></div>
  <div class="stats">
    <div><span>7-day</span><p>Free trial</p></div>
    <div><span>40+</span><p>Weekly classes</p></div>
    <div><span>No</span><p>Contract lock-in</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="plans">
  <h2>Pick your pace</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="p"><div class="k">Classes</div><div class="price">$89<small>/mo</small></div><ul><li>Unlimited group classes</li><li>App workout tracking</li><li>Open gym access</li></ul></div>
    <div class="p hot"><div class="k">Most popular</div><div class="price">$149<small>/mo</small></div><ul><li>Everything in Classes</li><li>2 personal sessions/mo</li><li>Nutrition coaching</li></ul></div>
    <div class="p"><div class="k">1:1 Coaching</div><div class="price">$249<small>/mo</small></div><ul><li>Weekly private sessions</li><li>Custom programming</li><li>Priority scheduling</li></ul></div>
  </div>
</section>
<footer class="foot"><span>© 2026 IRONHAUS · Tampa, FL</span><span>Open 5am–10pm · (813) 555-0155</span></footer>
</body></html>
